              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners were represented by Paul\u202fW.\u202fHughes, Esq.; the respondent was represented by Frederick\u202fLiu."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether the government\u2019s theory permits courts to review not only whether the Board articulated the right theory but also whether it actually used the right theory."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked what the case teaches about the question before the Court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan commented on the breadth of Justice Gorsuch\u2019s question."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh noted that the statute does not specifically refer to mixed questions and suggested it refers to pure questions of law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 29,
              "start": 29
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked the parties to succinctly state the questions of law in the two cases."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 35,
              "start": 35
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked whether the government\u2019s position is that only pure questions of law are reviewable or also egregious applications that rise to questions of law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 46,
              "start": 46
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer stated that the text says \u201cquestions of law\u201d and that statutes using those words clearly mean both."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 50,
              "start": 50
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor reiterated the presumption in favor of judicial review."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 51,
              "start": 51
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked if that presumption \u201cbegs the question.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 52
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 53,
              "start": 53
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether the presumption is only about congressional intent and noted that Congress wanted to cut off review for criminal aliens."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "9e0320f4515ed0c5f442e97fce632f2a39ec3d94c0ebf69acea49820d93f0041",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-9e0320f4515e-0002-0009"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 55,
              "start": 55
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Breyer asked the parties what they think about the presumption."
      }
    ],
